   "climate": {
    "text": "Insubrian mesoclimate with some Mediterranean traits, relatively mild in winter and not too hot in summer, with Lake Iseo easing temperatures. Rain is about 1000 mm a year, 500 to 600 mm in the growing season. Winkler index is 1800 to 2300 degree days.",
    "cite": [
     "franciacorta-disc:p12",
     "franciacorta-disc:p13"
    ]
   },
   "soil": {
    "text": "Mostly glacial moraine, fairly deep, well drained, with good or high water reserve. Six vocational units are named, from thin moraine to deep colluvium.",
